{"id":93,"slug":"93-margin-collapsing-la-gi","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Box Model","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Margin collapsing là gì?","question_en":"What is margin collapsing?","answer_vi":"Khi hai margin **theo chiều dọc** chạm nhau, browser gộp thành một, lấy **giá trị lớn hơn** chứ không cộng.\n\n```css\n.a { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.b { margin-top: 20px; }\n/* khoảng cách thực tế giữa .a và .b = 30px, không phải 50px */\n```\n\nBa tình huống xảy ra:\n\n```html\n<!-- 1. anh em liền kề -->\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">A</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px\">B</p>          <!-- cách 30px -->\n\n<!-- 2. cha - con: margin con \"thoát\" ra ngoài cha -->\n<div style=\"background:#eee\">              <!-- không padding, không border -->\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:40px\">Tiêu đề</h2> <!-- 40px đẩy CẢ div xuống -->\n</div>\n\n<!-- 3. cha rỗng: margin-top và margin-bottom của chính nó gộp lại -->\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0\"></div>          <!-- chiếm 20px, không phải 40px -->\n```\n\n**Không xảy ra** với: margin ngang, flex item, grid item, element `position: absolute/fixed`, element tạo **block formatting context** (`overflow: hidden`, `display: flow-root`).\n\nCách chặn ở trường hợp cha–con:\n\n```css\n.parent { display: flow-root; }    /* sạch nhất, không tác dụng phụ */\n```\n\n**Chốt thực dụng:** dùng `gap` của flex/grid thay cho margin dọc giữa các item: `gap` không bị gộp nên không phải nhớ quy tắc này","answer_en":"When two **vertical** margins touch, the browser merges them into one and keeps the **larger** value instead of adding them.\n\n```css\n.a { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.b { margin-top: 20px; }\n/* the real gap between .a and .b is 30px, not 50px */\n```\n\nThree situations where it happens:\n\n```html\n<!-- 1. adjacent siblings -->\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:30px\">A</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:20px\">B</p>          <!-- 30px apart -->\n\n<!-- 2. parent-child: the child margin \"escapes\" the parent -->\n<div style=\"background:#eee\">              <!-- no padding, no border -->\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:40px\">Title</h2>   <!-- 40px pushes the WHOLE div down -->\n</div>\n\n<!-- 3. empty element: its own top and bottom margins collapse together -->\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0\"></div>          <!-- occupies 20px, not 40px -->\n```\n\n**It does not happen** with: horizontal margins, flex items, grid items, absolutely/fixed positioned elements, or elements that establish a **block formatting context** (`overflow: hidden`, `display: flow-root`).\n\nBlocking the parent-child case:\n\n```css\n.parent { display: flow-root; }    /* cleanest, no side effects */\n```\n\n**Practical takeaway:** use flex/grid `gap` instead of vertical margins between items — nothing collapses and you never have to recall these rules","answer_html_vi":"<p>Khi hai margin <strong>theo chiều dọc</strong> chạm nhau, browser gộp thành một, lấy <strong>giá trị lớn hơn</strong> chứ không cộng.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".a { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.b { margin-top: 20px; }\n/* khoảng cách thực tế giữa .a và .b = 30px, không phải 50px */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.a</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-bottom</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">30px</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.b</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-top</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20px</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* khoảng cách thực tế giữa .a và .b = 30px, không phải 50px */</span></code></pre></div><p>Ba tình huống xảy ra:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 1. anh em liền kề --&gt;\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:30px&quot;&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:20px&quot;&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;          &lt;!-- cách 30px --&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 2. cha - con: margin con &quot;thoát&quot; ra ngoài cha --&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;background:#eee&quot;&gt;              &lt;!-- không padding, không border --&gt;\n  &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin-top:40px&quot;&gt;Tiêu đề&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;!-- 40px đẩy CẢ div xuống --&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 3. cha rỗng: margin-top và margin-bottom của chính nó gộp lại --&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;          &lt;!-- chiếm 20px, không phải 40px --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 1. anh em liền kề --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin-bottom:30px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>A<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin-top:20px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>B<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- cách 30px --&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 2. cha - con: margin con &quot;thoát&quot; ra ngoài cha --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;background:#eee&quot;</span>&gt;</span>              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- không padding, không border --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin-top:40px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Tiêu đề<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 40px đẩy CẢ div xuống --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 3. cha rỗng: margin-top và margin-bottom của chính nó gộp lại --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin:20px 0&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- chiếm 20px, không phải 40px --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Không xảy ra</strong> với: margin ngang, flex item, grid item, element <code>position: absolute/fixed</code>, element tạo <strong>block formatting context</strong> (<code>overflow: hidden</code>, <code>display: flow-root</code>).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Cách chặn ở trường hợp cha–con:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".parent { display: flow-root; }    /* sạch nhất, không tác dụng phụ */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.parent</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">display</span>: flow-root; }    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* sạch nhất, không tác dụng phụ */</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Chốt thực dụng:</strong> dùng <code>gap</code> của flex/grid thay cho margin dọc giữa các item: <code>gap</code> không bị gộp nên không phải nhớ quy tắc này.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>When two <strong>vertical</strong> margins touch, the browser merges them into one and keeps the <strong>larger</strong> value instead of adding them.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".a { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.b { margin-top: 20px; }\n/* the real gap between .a and .b is 30px, not 50px */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.a</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-bottom</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">30px</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.b</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-top</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20px</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* the real gap between .a and .b is 30px, not 50px */</span></code></pre></div><p>Three situations where it happens:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 1. adjacent siblings --&gt;\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:30px&quot;&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:20px&quot;&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;          &lt;!-- 30px apart --&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 2. parent-child: the child margin &quot;escapes&quot; the parent --&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;background:#eee&quot;&gt;              &lt;!-- no padding, no border --&gt;\n  &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin-top:40px&quot;&gt;Title&lt;/h2&gt;   &lt;!-- 40px pushes the WHOLE div down --&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 3. empty element: its own top and bottom margins collapse together --&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin:20px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;          &lt;!-- occupies 20px, not 40px --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 1. adjacent siblings --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin-bottom:30px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>A<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin-top:20px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>B<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 30px apart --&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 2. parent-child: the child margin &quot;escapes&quot; the parent --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;background:#eee&quot;</span>&gt;</span>              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- no padding, no border --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin-top:40px&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Title<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 40px pushes the WHOLE div down --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 3. empty element: its own top and bottom margins collapse together --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;margin:20px 0&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- occupies 20px, not 40px --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>It does not happen</strong> with: horizontal margins, flex items, grid items, absolutely/fixed positioned elements, or elements that establish a <strong>block formatting context</strong> (<code>overflow: hidden</code>, <code>display: flow-root</code>).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Blocking the parent-child case:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".parent { display: flow-root; }    /* cleanest, no side effects */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.parent</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">display</span>: flow-root; }    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* cleanest, no side effects */</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Practical takeaway:</strong> use flex/grid <code>gap</code> instead of vertical margins between items — nothing collapses and you never have to recall these rules.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Mastering margin collapsing","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_box_model/Mastering_margin_collapsing"},{"label":"MDN — Block formatting context","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_display/Block_formatting_context"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/91-box-model-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Box model gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/92-box-sizing-content-box-vs-border-box","title":"box-sizing: content-box vs border-box?"},{"url":"/q/77-cascade-trong-css-nghia-la-gi","title":"Cascade trong CSS nghĩa là gì?"},{"url":"/q/79-inheritance-trong-css-la-gi","title":"Inheritance trong CSS là gì?"},{"url":"/q/80-don-vi-px-em-rem-vw-vh-khac-nhau","title":"Đơn vị px, em, rem, %, vw, vh khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/81-important-dung-khi-nao-tai-sao-nen-tranh","title":"!important dùng khi nào? Tại sao nên tránh?"},{"url":"/q/87-has-selector-la-gi","title":":has() selector là gì?"},{"url":"/q/88-combinator-selectors-space-khac-nhau","title":"Combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) khác nhau?"}]}